# Generated native projects.
# Capacitor regenerates these from `npx cap add android|ios`. They are ignored while the shell is
# bare scaffolding. Once you start customizing them (signing, splash, AndroidManifest permissions,
# Info.plist), REMOVE the two lines below and commit android/ and ios/ so the customizations stick.
/android/
/ios/

